---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { breadcrumb, webPage } from '../data/schema';

const path = '/terms/';
const title = `Terms & Conditions | ${site.name}`;
const description = `Terms and Conditions and SMS / Text Messaging Terms of Service for ${site.name}.`;
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} schema={[webPage(path, title, description), breadcrumb([['Home', '/'], ['Terms & Conditions', path]])]}>
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms of service</p>
    <h1>Terms &amp; <em>Conditions.</em></h1>
    <p class="mono updated">Last updated: October 14, 2026</p>

    <p>Please read these Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") carefully before using this website or submitting any inquiry to {site.currentEntity} ("{site.name}", "we", "our", or "us"). By accessing this website or communicating with us, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</p>

    <h2>1. General Information &amp; Real Estate Disclaimers</h2>
    <p>This website provides informational content regarding new homes, communities, semi-custom construction, and floor plans offered by {site.currentEntity} in Tehachapi and eastern Kern County, California.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Illustrative Purpose:</strong> Architectural floor plans, renderings, virtual representations, measurements, specifications, and photography on this website are conceptual and approximate. Actual construction, dimensions, window placements, finishes, and features may vary by homesite and elevation.</li>
      <li><strong>Pricing &amp; Availability:</strong> Base pricing, homesite availability, construction timelines, and promotional incentives (such as early-buyer credits or financing options) are subject to change, prior sale, or withdrawal without prior notice. Contact our sales office to confirm current homesite availability and specifications.</li>
      <li><strong>Financing Programs:</strong> 0% down financing options and rate buydown programs are subject to buyer eligibility, credit approval, and lender guidelines. {site.name} is a licensed general building contractor ({site.license}), not a mortgage lender or broker. Nothing on this website constitutes a loan commitment or financial advice.</li>
      <li><strong>Equal Housing Opportunity:</strong> We are committed to the letter and spirit of U.S. and California policy for the achievement of equal housing opportunity throughout the nation. We encourage and support affirmative advertising and marketing programs in which there are no barriers to obtaining housing because of race, color, religion, sex, handicap, familial status, or national origin.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. SMS &amp; Mobile Text Messaging Terms (TCPA / 10DLC Compliant)</h2>
    <p>These Mobile Messaging Terms govern text messages (SMS and MMS) sent by or on behalf of {site.name}.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Program Purpose:</strong> {site.name} may reply by text to people who text our business number first. Replies answer questions about our homes, floor plans, financing programs and tours. We do not send marketing texts and we do not text people first. Text HOMES to {site.phone}. See the <a href="/sms-terms/">Text Messaging Terms</a> for how it works.</li>
      <li><strong>How It Starts:</strong> Texting starts only when you send a text to our business number. Giving us your phone number on a form or to our chat or phone assistant lets us call or email you about your request; it does not sign you up for text messages.</li>
      <li><strong>Consent Not a Condition of Purchase:</strong> Agreeing to text with us is <strong>not</strong> a condition of purchasing any property, home, goods, or services from {site.name}.</li>
      <li><strong>Message Frequency:</strong> We reply only to texts you send. Expect up to a few replies to each message you send.</li>
      <li><strong>Message &amp; Data Rates:</strong> Message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile service carrier and wireless plan. Check with your wireless carrier for details regarding your text messaging plan.</li>
      <li><strong>Opt-Out Instructions (STOP):</strong> You can cancel or opt out of receiving text messages at any time. Simply reply <strong>STOP</strong>, <strong>CANCEL</strong>, <strong>END</strong>, <strong>QUIT</strong>, or <strong>UNSUBSCRIBE</strong> to any text message from {site.name}, or text <strong>STOP</strong> to <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>. After sending STOP, we will send you a single confirmation text message confirming your unsubscribe request. No further text messages will be sent to your mobile number unless you re-subscribe.</li>
      <li><strong>Customer Support &amp; Help (HELP):</strong> For assistance or questions regarding text messaging, reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message, email us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or call our office at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Carrier Liability:</strong> Compatible mobile carriers in the United States include AT&amp;T, T-Mobile, Verizon Wireless, Sprint, and other major regional carriers. Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
      <li><strong>Strict Mobile Privacy:</strong> Your mobile phone number, SMS opt-in data, and text messaging consent will <strong>not</strong> be sold, rented, or shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes under any circumstances. For full details, review our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
    <p>All content on this website—including floor plans, blueprints, text, photographs, graphics, renderings, logos, and software code—is the property of {site.currentEntity} or its content licensors and is protected by United States and international copyright, trademark, and intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works without prior written consent from {site.name}.</p>

    <h2>4. Contractor Licensing</h2>
    <p>{site.currentEntity} is licensed by the California Contractors State License Board under license number {site.license} (Class B &ndash; General Building Contractor). Licensing information can be verified directly at <a href="https://www.cslb.ca.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.cslb.ca.gov<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>

    <h2>5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
    <p>This website and all materials are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, {site.name} disclaims all warranties, express or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.</p>

    <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>In no event shall {site.currentEntity}, its directors, officers, employees, or agents be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages arising out of or in connection with your access to or use of this website, its content, or communications received from us.</p>

    <h2>7. Governing Law &amp; Jurisdiction</h2>
    <p>These Terms and any disputes arising out of or related to your use of this website or communications with us shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of California, without regard to its conflict of law principles. Any legal proceeding arising out of these Terms shall be instituted exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Kern County, California.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. When we make updates, we will revise the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Your continued use of the website following the posting of revised Terms constitutes your acceptance of the changes.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about these Terms or our text messaging practices, please contact us:</p>
    <p class="mono contact-block">
      {site.currentEntity}<br />
      {site.address}<br />
      Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a><br />
      Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 760px; }
  .updated { font-size: .75rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 2.2rem; }
  .prose ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose li { margin-bottom: .6rem; }
  .prose a { color: var(--clay); }
  .contact-block { background: var(--bone); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 4px; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem; }
</style>
